# Token & context discipline

Shape non-trivial requests before acting:

```
intent -> scope -> constraints -> known context -> missing context -> plan -> verification
```

- Pull real context (files, command output, upstream docs) before guessing. This repo has
  ~150 root scripts; grep for the exact symbol rather than reading broadly.
- `AGENTS.md` is ~400 lines and `DATA_CONTRACT.md` is the authority on layers. Read the
  relevant section, not the whole file.
- Compress long context; keep critical facts at the start and end, not buried.
- Stop when acceptance criteria are met. Match depth to need.
